  "body": "### What is the issue with the Storage Standard?\n\nAccording to the specification, [storage is not available to opaque origins](https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#obtain-a-storage-key).\n\nIn at least Firefox, Chrome and Edge, storage is available to the `file` scheme, despite that scheme using opaque origins.\n\nThis is a contradiction, which will hopefully be resolved by bringing the standard in line with the implementations.",
